# Keep cloud build contexts small — demo videos + local artefacts never
# belong in an image. (Model weights download on first use and are cached.)
#
# NOTE: samples/ IS shipped in the backend image (see Dockerfile COPY) so the
# HF free demo can seed a video-file stream with zero setup.
# Only samples/demo.mp4 is needed — large raw captures stay out.
*.mp4
!samples/demo.mp4
.venv/
.venv-*/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.git/
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.pt
*.onnx
*.engine
models/
tools/
demo/
ppt_visual_results/
test_results/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
*.webm
*.jpg
.env

